==In animation==
[[File:Brycen Beartic Scene.png|thumb|250px|Brycen and his Beartic in a movie called "{{DL|Movies in the Pokémon world|Enter the Beartic}}" in {{aniseries|BW}}]]
===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|BW}}====
Brycen made his debut in ''[[BW078|Guarding the Guardian of the Mountain!]]'', where he and his {{p|Beartic}} saved {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} from a falling boulder. {{an|Cilan}} was the first to recognize him as a famous movie star who had the lead role in many movies up until he decided to quit acting. Brycen later explained that he had chosen to quit acting because of an accident during the filming of another movie.
{{-}}

==In the manga==
[[File:Brycen-Man Adventures.png|thumb|left|150px|Brycen as Brycen-Man in [[Pokémon Adventures]]]]
[[File:Sabrina B2W2 chapter.png|thumb|150px|Sabrina as a Movie Star in Pokémon Adventures]]
===Pokémon Adventures===
In ''[[PS530|Movie Panic]]'', it was revealed that Sabrina had become a star actress at the Pokéstar Studios. Using one of her {{p|Alakazam}}'s [[Spoons of Destiny]], she guided the reluctant {{adv|Whitley}} to perform in a [[Brycen-Man Series|Brycen-Man]] movie. During the filming, Whitley played the heroine, while Brycen, who had returned to being a movie actor, played the movie's titular villain.
{{-}}

